                    <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-6 border border-line mb-6">
                        <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                            <div class="bg-cy rounded-full w-2 h-2 mr-3"></div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Two-Part Coursework System</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                            A comprehensive C programming project implementing custom image file formats with sophisticated compression algorithms.
                            Built as the foundation coursework for systems programming, demonstrating advanced low-level programming concepts
                            typically found in computer graphics and systems programming courses.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Coursework 1 - Foundation (50%)</h4>
                            <ul class="text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-1">
                                <li>• 10 executable programs</li>
                                <li>• 3 custom file formats (EBF, EBU, EBC)</li>
                                <li>• Echo, Compare, Convert utilities</li>
                                <li>• Modular architecture with memory management</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-white/[.02] rounded-lg p-4">
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white mb-2">Coursework 2 - Advanced (50%)</h4>
